Define rules that torch.nn.AdaptiveAvgPool3d API parameters should satisfy. Refer to the API documentation. Particularly, there should be at least one rule to suppress each error message.

Type is encoded as an integer (index of the following list):
[bool, np.int8, np.int16, np.int32, np.int64, np.uint8, np.float16, np.float32, np.float64, np.complex64, np.complex128, str, np.dtype]

